{
  "input": {
    "rationale": "Promoting the install-route mechanism into durable reuse so later work does not have to re-derive it from the receipt. The witness is CheckRun e5116cfe896549deb27799d6d871ed77 (parsed indices 1 and 2): the leader snapshotted at index 8 while the added voter was isolated, and after reconnection that voter installed the snapshot at index 8 while its log store's last index was only 5, giving store_emptied=true and should_snapshot=true. This complements the existing TrailingLogs=0 witness and the same arithmetic Fact, and it changes no verdict: the asserted defect, its bounded consequence and its limitations stand as recorded.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "id": "should_snapshot",
        "file": "snapshot.go",
        "start_line": 104,
        "end_line": 120,
        "kind": "code_observation"
      },
